        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2534] If the EVCC receives the parameter ECDHCurve set to \"X448\", it shall use the private key associated with the \"Alternate Subject Public Key\" of the OEM provisioning certificate along with the public key calculated from [V2G20-2532] for calculation of the session key as defined by [V2G20-2535].",
            "block_bbox": [
